# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# irth-os — monorepo environment reference
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This is an index of where env vars live. Each app has its own
# .env.example with the full, authoritative list — copy those:
#
#   apps/api/.env.example    → apps/api/.env        (Hono API on Cloudflare Workers)
#   apps/admin/.env.example  → apps/admin/.env.local (Next.js admin dashboard)
#
# In production, secrets are provisioned per platform, NOT via .env files:
#   • API   → `wrangler secret put <KEY>` (see apps/api/wrangler.toml)
#   • Admin → Cloudflare Pages project environment variables
#
# NEVER commit real secrets. These .example files document keys only.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Shared by BOTH apps — must hold the SAME value in each:
#   DATABASE_URL         PostgreSQL / Supabase connection string
#   BETTER_AUTH_SECRET   session signing secret (identical across api + admin)

# See apps/api/.env.example    for: Paymob, Fawry, Bosta, Aramex, ETA, Resend, R2, rate-limit tuning
# See apps/admin/.env.example  for: NEXT_PUBLIC_* URLs, Supabase client keys, platform-admin gating
